{"schema_version": 2, "id": "sebastian_v2_background", "npc": "sebastian", "title": "塞巴斯蒂安 Sebastian / background", "text": "塞巴斯蒂安 Sebastian 的母亲是罗宾 Robin，继父是德米特里厄斯 Demetrius，玛鲁 Maru 是同母异父的妹妹；原版房间在木匠家地下室。", "tags": ["sebastian", "identity"], "aliases": ["family home parents identity", "家人 家庭 住处 身份"], "priority": 1, "content_kind": "canonical_fact", "conditions": {}, "review_status": "source_checked_needs_human_review", "sources": [{"kind": "wiki", "url": "https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Sebastian", "section": "Introduction / Relationships", "checked_on": "2026-09-15", "method": "paraphrase"}], "source_url": "https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Sebastian"}
